1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,550
Mum: Peter! Get up, You're late

2
00:00:04,350 --> 00:00:06,100
Peter: What time is it?

3
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:08,470
Mum: A quarter past six.

4
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:12,300
Peter: It's too early, School is at eight.

5
00:00:12,725 --> 00:00:14,675
Mum: But you're on duty today!

6
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:17,200
Peter: Oh, no I'm late!

7
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:23,200
Mum: Quickly There's no time for a shower. Get dressed and go.

8
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,650
Peter: I can still brush my teeth.

9
00:00:26,125 --> 00:00:30,200
Mum: And here's your breakfast. Take it to school.

10
00:00:30,725 --> 00:00:32,975
Peter: Thank you, Mum! Bye

11
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:34,125
Mum: Be safe.

